==Icelandic==
===Etymology===
Old Norse
===Adjective===
[[heill]] {{m}}, [[heil]] {{f}}, [[heilt]] {{n}}

# [[whole]], [[in one piece]]

2heil/l adj
1. (óskaddaður) in one piece, undamaged

2. (heilbrigður) healthy, recovered
taka aldrei á ~um sér
be always in bad health
3. (allur) complete, whole
~t ár
a whole year
~ar tölur
integers
4. (falslaus) sincere
5. phrases
ráða e-m ~t
give sby sound advice
með ~um hug
with all one's heart
~~ og sæll!
welcome!
vagninn fer á ~um og hálfum tíma
the buses leave every half hour


